</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES PLC - IOTA<br><br>SHARE ISSUE<br><br>Reference is made to the announcement dated 26.10.2023 in relation to invitation to subscribe for SNDR in Independent Oil & Resources Plc.<br>Following the completion of the offering, 21.780.419 new shares of a nominal value of NOK 1,00 were issued and allotted at a price of NOK 1,00 per share.<br>Following the issue and allotment, the paid-up share capital of Independent Oil & Resources Plc has been increased by NOK 21.780.419,00 and is now divided into 95.833.630 shares of a nominal value of NOK 1,00 per share for the total consideration of NOK 95.833.630,00.<br>The total authorized share capital of the Company stands at 95.833.630 shares of a nominal value of NOK 1,00 per share.</p></td>
</tr>
