<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES PLC - IOTA<br><br>AMENDMENT OF MATURITY DATE FOR STOCK OPTIONS IN PETROLIA NOCO AS<br><br>Reference is made to stock notice dated 9.12.2022 re invitation to subscribe for stock options in Petrolia NOCO AS.<br>  <br>The stock option agreement was closely linked to the drilling programme of Petrolia NOCO AS for 2023. This programme has been moved into 2024.<br><br>The Board of Directors has therefore decided to amend the maturity date for the stock options to December 20, 2024.</p></td>
</tr>
