<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2021-05-21 17:46:47</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES PLC - IOTA<br><br>SHARE ISSUE<br><br>Reference is made to the announcement dated 28.4.2021 in relation to invitation to subscribe for new shares in Independent Oil & Resources Plc.<br><br>Following the completion of the offering, 15.000.000 new shares of a nominal value of NOK 1,00 were issued and allotted at a price of NOK 2,00 per share.<br><br>Following the issue and allotment, the paid-up share capital of Independent Oil & Resources Plc has been increased by NOK 15.000.000,00 and is now<br><br>divided into 74.053.211 shares of a nominal value of NOK 1,00 per share for the total consideration of NOK 74.053.211,00.<br><br> <br><br>The total authorized share capital of the Company stands at 95.833.630 shares of a nominal value of NOK 1,00 per share.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://independentresources.eu/">
http://independentresources.eu/</a>
