<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES PLC - IOTA</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2016-10-25 08:14:37</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to the announcement dated 31st August 2016 in relation to a rights issue.<br><br>Following the completion of the offering, 9,886,485 new shares of a nominal value of NOK 2.50 where issued and allotted at a price of NOK 3.50 per share.<br><br>Following the issue and allotment, the paid up share capital of Independent Oil & Resources Plc has been increased by NOK 24,716,212.50 and is now divided into 24,053,211 shares of a nominal value NOK 2.50 per share for the total consideration of NOK 60,133,027.50. <br><br>The total authorised share capital of the Company now stands at 28,333,452 shares of nominal value of NOK 2.50 per share</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES PLC - IOTA</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2016-08-31 16:41:14</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Information - Rights Issue in Independent Oil & Resources PLC<br><br>There will be carried out a Rights Issue in Independent Oil & Resources PLC ("the Company").  The background for the rights issue is both to enable the Company to take part in an expected restructuring within the Oil & Gas segment, but also to strengthen the Company's financial options, so that the Company is able to act quickly in order to be able to take advantage of commercial options by acquiring other companies or assets within the company's main business area against a consideration consisting wholly or partly in shares in the company, and to support current investments.<br><br>The Rights Issue comprises an offering of up to 14 166 726 new shares, with a subscription price of NOK 3,50 per share.  The Board has decided not to engage any broker house for the Rights Issue, but will carry out the Rights Issue itself.<br><br>The invitation for this Rights Issue is sent to the 99 largest shareholders in the company as of 31 August 2016.  The Subscription Period in the Offering will last from and including 31 August 2016 to and including 14 September 2016.  The book will close at 17:30 hours (Cyprus time) on 14 September 2016 after which no further orders will be accepted.<br><br>All shareholders who have  received this invitation are invited to actively consider whether they would like to subscribe for New Shares.<br><br>Allocation of New Shares will be based on the number of shares subscribed.  In case of over-subscription, allocation will be determined based on a pro rata basis based on the number of shares held by the shareholder prior to the Offering.<br><br>No prospectus has been prepared for this Offering as the number of invited investors do not exceed 100.  Latest financial reports for the Company can be found at www.independentresources.eu.  No major subsequent events since last reporting.<br><br>For Subsciption, please notify the Company within the closing date either by fax +357 25 356500 or by email to ddemou@fidelius.com.cy<br><br>Sincerely<br>Independent Oil & Resources PLC<br>Jan Egil Moe, Chair<br>(Sign)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
