</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to the announcement dated 24th November 2014 in relation to a private placement.<br><br>Following the completion of the offering and the issue of 85.491 new shares, Independent Oil & Resources Plc share capital has been increased by NOK 213.727,50.  The new share capital is NOK 43.444.080 comprised of 17.377.632 shares with a nominal value of NOK 2.50 per share.<br><br>All shares allocated as a result of the offering have now been registered with VPS System.<br><br><br>Limassol, 5th January 2015<br><br>Independent Oil & Resources Plc<br>Jan Egil Moe<br>Chaiman</p></td>
</tr>
