<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Det er foretatt endringer i Independent Oil & Resources Plc (ISIN:CY0104270919, ticker IOTA).  Aksjebeholdningen er redusert fra 958 508 828 til 11 585 089. Emisjonsverdien er redusert fra 9 585 088 280 til 95 850 882.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES PLC - IOTA - REVERSE SPLIT - NOW REGISTERED</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2014-11-12 07:54:00</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>REVERSE SPLIT - NOW REGISTERED IN VPS<br><br>Reference is made to stock notices dated 5 November 2014 and 11 November 2014 re share issue and reverse split.<br><br>The share issue and the reverse split of the shares (1:100) have now been registered in VPS.<br><br>New issued share capital is NOK28.962.722,50 divided into 11.585.089 shares, each with a nominal value of NOK2,50.<br><br>One new share equals 100 old shares.<br><br><br>Independent Oil & Resources Plc<br>Jan Egil Moe<br>Chairman</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES PLC - IOTA - REVERSE SPLIT</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2014-11-11 09:40:46</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>REVERSE SPLIT - REGISTRATION IN VPS<br><br>Reference is made to stock notice dated 5th November 2014 re minutes from EGM held in Limassol on 5th November 2014.<br><br>The share issue and the reverse split of the shares (1:100) will be updated in VPS today, Tuesday 11th November 2014, after trading hours to reflect the new share balances.<br><br>As of tomorrow, Wednesday 12th November 2014, the shares will be traded with new nominal value where 1 new share equals 100 old shares.<br><br><br>Independent Oil & Resources Plc<br>Jan Egil Moe<br>Chairman</p></td>
</tr>
