<td colspan="3"><p>Limassol, 30.08.2013<br><br>Enclosed please find interim financial figures for the period 1.1.2013 - 30.6.2013.<br><br>The transition process for relocating the company's headquarters from Norway to Cyprus with permanent registration in the Cypriot Registrer of Enterprises has now been completed.<br><br><br>The company was deregistered from the Norwegian Register of Enterprises on 25th July 2013, and was permanently registered in the Cyprus Register of Enterprises on the 12th August 2013.  As of this date the company has the following name and contact address:<br><br>Independent Oil & Resources PLC<br>27, Spyrou Kyprianou Avenue<br>4001 Mesa Geitonia<br>Limassol <br>Cyprus<br>Tel. + 357 25 356 000<br><br>General Manager<br>Demos Demou<br>ddemou@fidelius.com.cy</p></td>
