<td><h2>IOTA: INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES ASA - COMPULSORY ACQUISITION OF SMALL SHAREHOLDINGS</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2013-03-22 10:44:08</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to letter dated 20. February 2013 re compulsory acquisition of small shareholdings that have a market capitalization of less than NOK 500, which the Public Companies Act §4-24 subsection 2 allows for.<br>A total of 2.497 283 shares were acquired, comprising a total of 5.563 shareholders.  Following the acquisition the company now haS 779 shareholders. <br>For further information - please contact Jan Egil Moe, Chairman of the Board, phone : +47 40400430.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
