<td colspan="3"><p>CORRECTED NOTICE<br> <br><br>APPROVED PROSPECTUS<br><br><br>The Financial Supervisory Authority of Norway has approved the following<br>prospectus:	<br><br>Rights Issue of up to 213,003,073 new shares towards existing shareholders in Independent Oil & Resources ASA. The subscription price is NOK 0.14 per share.<br><br>The subscription period is from and including 30 September 2010 to 13 October 2010 at 17:30 CET.<br><br>The Manager of the Rights Issue is First Securities AS. The prospectus will be available on the following web sites:<br><br>www.independentresources.no<br>www.first.no<br><br>The prospectus together with subscription form will also be available free of charge at the business offices of Independent Oil & Resources ASA and First Securities AS.<br><br>This information is subject of the disclosure requirements according to §5-12 of the Norwegian Securities Trading Act.<br><br>For further information - please contact Jan Egil Moe : Phone +47 40400430.<br><br><br>Bergen, 29 September 2010 <br>Board of Directors</p></td>
