<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES ASA - PRIVATE PLACEMENT - CORRECTION</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2009-06-09 15:39:15</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Independent Oil and Resources ASA (IO&R) - Private Placement  - CORRECTION<br><br><br>IO&R has on 08 June 2009 completed a private placement of a total of 45,000,000 new shares, an increase of 11.8%, at a subscription price of NOK 0.20 per share. The gross proceeds from the private placement amounts to NOK 9,000,000.<br><br>The proceeds from the private placement will be used to strengthen IO&R's cash position hereunder reduce its debt related to investments. <br><br>Upon registration of the new shares issued in the private placement, IO&R's share capital will amount to NOK 10,650,153.65 - corresponding to 426,006,146 shares, each with a par value of NOK 0.025.<br><br>Following the transaction the company's two main shareholders, Increased Oil Recovery AS and Independent Oilfield Rentals Ltd. (including it's wholly owned company NET AS) own 151.211.041 shares (35,5%) and 118.745.589 shares (27,9%), respectively. <br><br> <br>Independent Oil and Resources ASA<br>Board of Directors, 09 June  2009</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://www.independentresources.no">
http://www.independentresources.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
