<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES ASA  -  PRIVATE PLACEMENT COMPLETED</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2008-12-10 08:54:15</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to Independent Oil and Resources ASA's ("IO&R") announcement dated 9 December 2008 regarding a possible private placement.<br><br>IO&R has on 10 December 2008 completed a private placement of a total of 30,000,000 new shares, an increase of 10%, at a subscription price of NOK 0.55 per share. The gross proceeds from the private placement amounts to NOK 16,500,000.<br><br>The proceeds from the planned private placement will be used to strengthen IO&R's cash position hereunder reduce its debt related to investments. <br><br>Upon registration of the new shares issued in the private placement, IO&R's share capital will amount to NOK 8,400,153 - corresponding to 336,006,146 shares, each with a par value of NOK 0.025.<br><br>The private placement was managed by ABG Sundal Collier.<br><br> <br>Independent Oil and Resources ASA<br>Board of Directors<br>10 December 2008 <br><br>For further information, please contact<br>Bernt Skeie, CFO: tel: +47 95 04 60 31</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://independentresources.no">
http://independentresources.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>INDEPENDENT OIL & RESOURCES ASA - PLANNED PRIVATE PLACEMENT OF NEW SHARES</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2008-12-09 17:31:56</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>NOT FOR DISTRIBUTION TO U.S. NEWS WIRE SERVICES OR FOR DISSEMINATION IN THE UNITED STATES OR TO U.S. INVESTORS<br><br>The board of directors of Independent Oil & Resources ASA ("IO&R") intends to carry out a private placement of up to 30,000,000 new shares (up to 10 percent of the existing number of shares). The planned private placement will be marketed to professional and institutional investors. <br><br>ABG Sundal Collier has been retained as manager in connection with the planned private placement.<br><br>The proceeds from the planned private placement will be used to strengthen IO&R's cash position hereunder reduce its debt related to investments. <br><br>IO&R is a significant shareholder in the publicly listed companies Petrolia Drilling ASA (22.2 %), Petrojack ASA (17.8%) and Marine Farms ASA (14.1%). In addition, IO&R is a large shareholder of OPRA Technologies ASA (6.8%), Epsis AS and Petro Resources Ltd. For further information, please refer to www.independentresources.no. <br><br>This news release shall not constitute an offer to sell or the solicitation of an offer to buy nor shall there be any sale of the securities in any state or jurisdiction in which such offer, solicitation or sale would be unlawful.<br><br> <br> <br>Independent Oil & Resources ASA<br>Board of Directors<br>9 December 2008 <br><br>For further information, please contact<br>Bernt Skeie, CEO: tel: +47 95 04 60 31</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://www.independentresources.no">
http://www.independentresources.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
