</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Independent Oil & Resources  ASA has on the 08 February  2008 bought 6.000.000 own shares in Independent Oil & Resources ASA.<br> <br>Independent Oil & Resources ASA has also settled a forward contract and taken delivery of 15.130.615 own shares in Independent Oil & Resources ASA.<br> <br>Following these transactions Independent Oil & Resources  ASA holds 23.662.855 own shares in the company, represented 7,7% of the outstanding shares. <br><br>Bergen/Stavanger, 17 October 2007.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
