http://www.independent.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Endring av aksje: IOT Holding ASA (IOTA)</h2></td>
<td><h3>Corporate actions</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2007-12-19 09:05:24</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
