<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>IOT HOLDING ASA - PETROLIA DRILLING ASA PURCHASED 25,000,000 SHARES IN PETROJACK ASA</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2007-02-02 09:31:12</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Petrolia Drilling ASA ("Petrolia Drilling") has on 1 February 2007 entered into an agreement to purchase 25,000,000 shares in Petrojack ASA ("Petrojack") by way of a share capital increase of 163,204,747 new shares in Petrolia Drilling. <br><br>Petrolia Drilling has entered into an agreement to purchase 25,000,000 Petrojack shares from IOT Holding ASA for a total consideration of NOK 550,000,000(equal to NOK 22.00 per Petrojack share). As compensation for the Petrojack shares, Petrolia Drilling has issued 163,204,747 new Petrolia Drilling shares at NOK 3.37 per share to IOT Holding ASA. The price per Petrojack share and the price per Petrolia Drilling share equals the closing prices on Oslo Børs on 1 February 2007.<br><br>Following the purchase of Petrojack shares, Petrolia Drilling holds 25,946,200 shares in Petrojack, corresponding to 39.93% of the shares outstanding. Petrolia Drilling holds no options, warrants or rights to further shares in Petrojack.<br><br>Petrolia Drilling has issued the new shares based on an authorization given to the board of directors of Petrolia Drilling by the general meeting on 22 June 2006.  <br><br>Following registration of the new shares, the share capital of Petrolia Drilling will increase from NOK 424,695,999 to NOK 506,298,372.5, and the number of shares, each with a par value of NOK 0.50, will increase from 849,391,998 to 1,012,596,745.<br><br>The new shares in Petrolia Drilling issued in the private placement will not be listed and tradeable on Oslo Børs until a listing prospectus has been approved. These new shares will therefore carry a separate ISIN (NO 001 0354038) until approval of the listing prospectus. The new Petrolia Drilling shares will in all other respects carry the same rights as the existing Petrolia Drilling shares upon registration of the share capital increase in the Register of Business Enterprises ("Foretaksregisteret").<br><br>The investments in Petrojack will give Petrolia Drilling exposure to modern jack-up rigs at attractive terms.<br><br>Following this transaction, Petrolia Drilling will have a diversified exposure to the offshore industry with a combination of new building of modern floaters and jack-ups, rental business as well as near term cashflow from existing units.<br><br><br>2 February 2007.<br><br>For further information, please contact:<br>Lars Moldestad, managing director: +47 906 99 197</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="https://www.independent.no">
https://www.independent.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>IOTA ASA - PETROLIA DRILLING ASA ACQUIRES INDEPENDENT OIL TOOLS AS.</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2007-01-25 11:10:00</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to stock exchange announcement 8th December 2006 regarding the agreement between Petrolia Services AS (former Petrolia Shashin AS) and IOT Holding ASA to acquire Independent Oil Tools AS. <br><br>The Due Diligence regarding Petrolia Services AS acquisition of Independent Oil Tools AS has now been completed without any findings resulting in adjustments of price or conditions.<br><br>Independent Oil Tools AS with subsidiaries consists of 90 employees.<br><br>Independent Oil Tools AS has been demerged and later merged with a sister company and has acquired another company. In accordance with accounts for Independent Oil Tools AS of 31.10.2006 the turn over was MNOK 155, the result before tax was MNOK 40,9 and total assets was  MNOK 412,5.<br><br><br>Historic pro forma profit and loss and balance sheet figures for Petrolia Drilling ASA/Independent Oil Tools AS will be presented according to IFRS as soon as it is available.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="https://www.independent.no">
https://www.independent.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Endring av aksje: IOT Holding ASA (IOTA)</h2></td>
<td><h3>Corporate actions</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2007-01-09 14:53:44</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Det er foretatt endringer i IOT Holding ASA (ISIN:NO0010248065, ticker IOTA).  Aksjebeholdningen er øket fra 233 006 146 til 306 006 146. Emisjonsverdien er øket fra 512 613 521 til 826 216 594.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>IOT HOLDING ASA - UPDATED CERTIFICATE OF REGISTRATION</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2007-01-08 15:27:21</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>IOT Holding ASA has on 08 January 2007 received an updated certificate of registration reflecting the 73,000,000 new shares issued in connection with the private placement on 05 January 2007.<br><br>The share capital is increased with NOK 1,825,000 from NOK 5,825,153.65 to NOK 7,650,153.65.  <br><br><br><br>Stavanger / Bergen 08 January 2007.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="https://www.independent.no">
https://www.independent.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>IOT HOLDING ASA - PRIVATE PLACEMENT COMPLETED</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2007-01-05 08:35:51</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to IOT Holding ASA's ("IOT") announcement dated 4 January 2007 regarding a possible private placement.<br><br>IOT has on 4 January 2007 completed a private placement of a total of 73,000,000 new shares, an increase of 31.3%, at a subscription price of NOK 2.70 per share. The gross proceeds from the private placement amounts to NOK 197,100,000.<br><br>The proceeds from the planned private placement will enable IOT to further expand its investment activities within the following segments: (i) oil services, (ii) oil, and (iii) other.<br><br>Upon registration of the new shares issued in the private placement, IOT's share capital will amount to NOK 7,650,153.65 - corresponding to 306,006,146 shares, each with a par value of NOK 0.025.<br><br>The private placement was managed by ABG Sundal Collier.<br><br> <br>IOT Holding ASA<br>Board of Directors<br>5 January 2007 <br><br>For further information, please contact<br>Erik Solheim, Chairman of the Board of Directors: tel: +47 91 15 20 31</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="https://www.independent.no">
https://www.independent.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>IOT HOLDING ASA - CONSIDERS PRIVATE PLACEMENT</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2007-01-04 16:40:33</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The Board of Directors of IOT Holding ASA ("IOT") intends to carry out a private placement of up to 73,000,000 new shares. The planned private placement will be marketed to professional and institutional investors. <br><br>ABG Sundal Collier has been retained as IOT's financial advisor in connection with the planned private placement.<br><br>After the sale of IOT's oilfield service activities, the Board of Directors of IOT intends to expand IOT's investment activities to include (i) oil service investments, (ii) oil investments, and (iii) other investments. IOT is currently the largest shareholder of Petrojack ASA (39.9%) and recently invested MNOK 100 in PetroProd Ltd. (18.3%). IOT also has significant holdings in Marine Farms ASA (13.7%).<br><br>The proceeds from the planned private placement will enable IOT to further expand its investment activities within the three above mentioned investment areas.<br><br>IOT received payment from the sale of IOT's oilfield service activities, Independent Oil Tools AS, in late December 2006. IOT does not expect significant adjustments to the previously announced sales amount of MNOK 380 after final completion of buyer's due diligence.<br><br> <br>IOT Holding ASA<br>Board of Directors<br>4 January 2007 <br><br>For further information, please contact<br>Erik Solheim, Chairman of the Board of Directors: tel: +47 91 15 20 31</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
