<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>INDEPENDENT OIL TOOLS ASA - NEW LEGAL STRUCTURE</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2006-10-16 14:59:19</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>With reference to the notice 12 May 2006, the reorganization of the company has been completed and has been registered at the Registrar in Brønnøysund. <br><br>The reorganization entails the establishment of a holding model, after which IOTA's operational activities have been placed in IOT Services AS, a wholly-owned subsidiary company owned by IOTA. <br>The administrative functions and the financial investments will remain in IOTA.<br><br>IOT Services AS will change name to Independent Oil Tools AS.<br><br><br>For further information, please contact:<br><br>Erik Solheim, Chairman of the Board of Independent Oil Tools ASA, tel +47 55 56 82 00<br><br><br>Bergen/Stavanger 16 October 2006.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="https://www.independent.no">
https://www.independent.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>INDEPENDENT OIL TOOLS ASA - NY JURIDISK STRUKTUR</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2006-10-16 14:55:05</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Det vises til melding 12. mai 2006 om omorganisering av IOTA. <br>Reorganiseringen av selskapet er gjennomført og registrert i Foretaksregisteret i Brønnøysund. <br><br>Reorganiseringen innebærer at det er etablert en holdingmodell, hvoretter IOTAs operasjonelle virksomhet blir liggende i IOT Services AS, et heleiet datterselskap av IOTA. Administrative funksjoner og finansielle investeringer vil bli liggende i IOTA.<br><br>IOT Services AS vil senere endre navn  til Independent Oil Tools AS. <br><br>Ytterligere opplysninger kan fås ved henvendelse til:<br><br>Erik Solheim, styreformann i Independent Oil Tools ASA, tel +47 55 56 82 00.<br><br><br>Bergen/Stavanger 16. oktober 2006.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
