<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Independent Oil Tools ASA ("IOT") has on 28 August 2006 bought  9,141,680 shares in Marine Farms ASA, corresponding to 14,393% of the shares outstanding in Marine Farms ASA.<br><br>Independent Oil Tools held no shares in Marine Farms , and no rights to shares in Marine Farms , before the above mentioned purchase. <br><br><br>Bergen, 29 August 2006</p></td>
