<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>IOT ASA - PRELIMINARY FIANCIAL REPORT 2nd QUARTER 2006</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2006-08-28 10:44:46</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Preliminary financial report for Independent Oil Tool ASA (IOTA), including Premium Casing Services Pty. Ltd. (PCS) for 2nd Quarter 2006.<br><br>Operating result is NOK 12,9 mill. and income before tax is NOK 73,2 mill. <br><br>Activity is expected to remain high also for the 3rd Quarter for IOT's core areas, and some improvement is expected also for PCS' activities, as delayed operations are getting started.<br><br>IOT will continue to look for investment opportunities, particularly in the rig market. which remains very strong.<br><br>Other events ;<br><br>Independent Oil Tools ASA ("IOT") has on 16 August 2006 sold 192,097,359 shares in Petrolia Drilling ASA ("PDR"), corresponding to 24.87% of the shares outstanding in PDR. <br><br>After the above mentioned sale of shares, IOT holds zero shares in PDR. IOT holds no rights to shares in PDR.<br><br>The effect of this transaction will be incorporated in the account for third Quarter 2006.<br><br><br>Bergen, Stavanger 28 August 2006.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="https://www.independent.no">
https://www.independent.no</a>
<a href="/public/news/4933.doc">
Regnskap 2Q 2006.doc</a>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
