<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2006-08-18 13:32:48</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>On 18 August 2006 Independent Oil Tools ASA (IOT ) has terminated a forward with planned settlement on 14 September 2006 and taken delivery and position of 9.100.000 shares in Petrojack ASA<br><br>IOT holds a total of 25.910.069 shares in Petrojack ASA, equal to 39,87 percent of the shares outstanding, including an American call option covering 800.000 shares with 14 September 2006 maturity.<br><br><br>Bergen, 18 August 2006</p></td>
</tr>
