<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>IOTA - PETROJACK ASA - DISCLOSURE OF HOLDINGS (flagging)</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2006-06-14 09:26:36</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>On 13 June 2006 Independent Oil Tools ASA (`IOT`) has carried out the following transactions with Petrojack-shares.<br><br>IOT has exercised a call-option of 800,000 shares at a strike price of NOK 10.00 per share.<br><br>IOT has sold 9,900,000 Petrojack-shares at a price of NOK 20.00 per share. <br><br>IOT has bought 9,100,000 Petrojack-shares at a price of NOK 20.4509 per share, with settlement on 14 September 2006.<br><br>IOT has bought an American call-option of 800,000 shares, with a strike price of NOK 10.00 per share, 14 September 2006 maturity and an option premium of NOK 10.3375 per share.<br><br>IOT holds 25,910,069 shares in Petrojack ASA, equal to 39.87 percent of the shares outstanding, <br>including the 9,100,000 shares held under the forward  contract described above and the option  contract covering 800,000 shares as described above.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
