<td><h2>IOT ASA - PETROJACK ASA - DISCLOSURE OF HOLDINGS (flagging)</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2006-02-02 09:33:25</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>On 1 February 2006 Independent Oil Tools ASA (“IOT”) has carried out a number of transactions with Petrojack-shares.<br><br>IOT has sold 4,800,000 Petrojack-shares at a price of NOK 20.0 per share.<br><br>IOT has bought 4,800,000 Petrojack-shares at a price of NOK 20.3238 per share, with settlement on 7 April 2006.<br><br>IOT has sold 800,000 Petrojack-shares at a price of NOK 20.0 per share.<br><br>IOT has bought an American call-option with a strike price of NOK 10.0 per share, 4 April 2006 maturity and an option premium of NOK 10.31 per share.<br><br>IOT has sold a European put-option with a strike price of NOK 10.0 per share, 4 April 2006 maturity and an option premium of NOK 0.10 per share.<br><br>IOT holds 20,880,069 shares in Petrojack ASA, equal to 34.41 percent of the shares outstanding, including the 5,600,000 shares, equal to 9.2 percent of the shares outstanding, held under the forward and options contracts described above.</p></td>
</tr>
