<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Independent Oil Tools ASA – private placement</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2005-09-22 10:35:31</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Independent Oil Tools ASA (“IOT”) carried out a private placement, subject to final board approval, of 46,000,000 shares (equals 28.05% of the share capital prior to the private placement), at a subscription price of NOK 2.60 per share, on September 21, 2005.  The private placement was significantly over-subscribed, with participation from Norwegian and international investors.<br><br>After board approval and registration of the private placement, the share capital of IOT will increase from NOK 4,100,153,65 to NOK 5,250,153,65, and the number of shares, each with a nominal value of NOK 0.025, will increase from 164,006,146 to 210,006,146.<br><br>The total gross private placement proceeds of NOK 119,600,000 will be used to finance IOT’s investment in PetroMENA AS (see announcement on OTC-list on September 21, 2005), and other investments in accordance with IOT’s strategy.<br><br>Independent Oil Tools ASA, <br><br>September 22, 2005</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://www.independent.no">
http://www.independent.no</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>IOT ASA - Investment i PetroMena AS</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2005-09-21 10:13:15</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Independent Oil Tools ASA (”IOT”) has been allocated 18 800 000 shares in the PetroMENA AS (“PetroMENA”) private placement on September 20, 2005. The subscription price per share equals NOK 5.50, thus the total amount allocated to IOT equals NOK 103 400 000.<br><br>Following the private placement in PetroMENA, IOT will hold 20% of the shares outstanding of PetroMENA. IOT is the leading industrial/strategic shareholder in PetroMENA.<br><br>The board of directors of IOT is pleased to have made another strategic rig investment at attractive terms. IOT intends to carry out a private placement in the near future to finance the strategic investment in PetroMENA.<br><br><br>For further information, please contact: Lars Moldestad (on behalf of the board of directors). Telephone: +47 55 22 47 06 or www.independent.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
