<td><h2>IOT ASA - Share Capital Increase</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2005-09-02 09:23:18</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Share capital increase<br><br>Independent Oil Tools ASA (“IOT”) has agreed to carry out a private placement of 14 500 000 shares (approximately 9.7% of the existing share capital) at a subscription price of NOK 2.60 per share.  The private placement was significantly over-subscribed.<br>The gross proceeds from the private placement equal approximately NOK 37.7 million. The proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes and investments in accordance with IOT’s strategy.<br>As a result of the private placement, the share capital of Independent Oil Tools will increase from NOK 3 737 636 to NOK 4 100 136, and the number of shares, each with a nominal value of NOK 0.025, will increase from 149 505 426, to 164 005 426.<br>The formal subscription of shares in the private placement will take place in a board meeting that will take place as soon as the authorization given to the board of directors by the general meeting on August 31, 2005 has been registered.<br><br><br>Independent Oil Tools ASA<br>September 1, 2005<br><br><br>For further information, please contact:<br>Unni F. Tefre (on behalf of the Board of Directors)<br>Telephone: +47 55 22 47 10 / +47 930 01 703<br>www.independent.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
