<td><h2>IIOT ASA - Investment in Petrojack ASA</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2005-08-10 10:33:56</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Independent Oil Tools ASA has on August 09, 2005 purchased 1.110.000 shares in Petrojack ASA for an average cash consideration of NOK 18,176. Following these purchases, Independent Oil Tools ASA  holds 3.077.923 shares in Petrojack ASA, corresponding to 5,32% of the share capital of Petrojack ASA.<br><br>In addition, Independent Oil Tools ASA has entered into agreements to purchase an additional 3.485.000 shares in Petrojack ASA at NOK 19,00 per share, with settlement in Independent Oil Tools ASA shares priced at NOK 2,40 per share. Following these purchases, Independent Oil Tools ASA will hold 6.562.923 shares in Petrojack ASA, corresponding to 11,35% of the share capital of Petrojack ASA.<br><br>The shareholders of Petrojack ASA who has accepted the offer from Independent Oil Tools ASA will receive a total of 27.589.583 shares in Independent Oil Tools ASA, which will bring the total number of shares in Independent Oil Tools ASA up to 149.506.145. A summon for an extraordinary general meeting will be distributed to approve this share capital increase.<br><br>Stavanger, August 10, 2005.<br><br><br>For further information, please contact:<br>Petter Tomren, chairman of the board of directors.<br>Telephone: +47 55 22 47 10<br>www.independent.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
