<td colspan="3"><p>Independent Oil Tools ASA has carried out a private placement of 10 900 000 shares (approximately 9.8% of the existing share capital) at a subscription price of NOK 2.15 per share. The gross proceeds from the private placement equal approximately NOK 23.4 million. The proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes.<br>As a result of the private placement, the share capital of Independent Oil Tools will increase from NOK 2 775 414 to NOK 3 047 914, and the number of shares, each with a nominal value of NOK 0.025, will increase from 111 016 562, to 121 916 562.<br><br><br>Independent Oil Tools ASA<br>August 8, 2005<br><br><br>For further information, please contact:<br>Petter Tomren, chairman of the board of directors.<br>Telephone: +47 55 22 47 10<br>www.independent.no</p></td>
