</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Independent Oil Tools ASA has been allocated 179 000 shares, at a subscription price of NOK 11.1 per share, in the Petrojack ASA private placement on June 21, 2005. Petter Tomren, chairman of the board of directors of Independent Oil Tools ASA, is a board member of Petrojack ASA.<br><br>Following the subscription of the above mentioned shares, Independent Oil Tools ASA holds a total of 1 967 923 shares in Petrojack ASA, corresponding to 3.4% of the share capital after registration of the new shares issued in connection with the private placement.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
