<td colspan="3"><p>Harald Smedsvik, CEO and board member of Independent Oil Tools ASA (“IOT”), purchased 1.000.000 shares in Independent Oil Tools ASA on June 1, 2005, at NOK 1,50 per share.<br><br>Harald Smedsvik holds 1.594.101 shares (1,9%) in IOT following this transaction.</p></td>
