<td><h2>IOT ASA - MANDATORY NOTIFICATION OF TRADE</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2005-05-27 10:45:03</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Independent Oil Tools ASA has been allocated <br>152 000 shares, at a subscription price of <br>NOK 7.15 per share, in the Petrojack ASA private placement on May 26, 2005. Petter Tomren, chairman of the board of directors of Independent Oil Tools ASA, is a board member of Petrojack ASA.<br><br>Following the subscription of the above mentioned shares, Independent Oil Tools ASA holds a total of 1 788 923 shares in Petrojack ASA, corresponding to 3.7% of the share capital after registration of the new shares issued in connection with the private placement.</p></td>
</tr>
