<td><h2>IOT ASA - 1st Quarter report 2005</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2005-05-19 09:52:42</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>1st quarter report, 2005. <br><br>Please find enclosed the financial report for Independent Oil Tools ASA for 1st quarter 2005. <br><br>Net pre-tax income is NOK 1.077.000. <br>The result is somewhat below budget, mainly due to agio loss related to the leasing contracts in US$ towards Petrolia Drilling. The pre-tax result for IOT`s core business is ahead of budget, reflecting the increase in drilling and testing activity this year compared to last year. <br><br>We expect the level of activity in the areas we operate in to remain high for the year as a whole, and believe we will achieve the budgeted result, or better, by year end. <br>Independent Oil Tools ASA <br><br>19th May 2005 <br><br>Contact person: <br><br>Harald Smedsvik <br>General manager <br>Tel. (+47) 51 81 94 10</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://www.independent.no">
http://www.independent.no</a>
<a href="/public/news/2930.doc">
Kvartalsregnskap, Q1-2005.doc</a>
</td>
</tr>
